# macOS-only extra for the CI screenshot job: python/scripts/_capture.py uses
# Quartz to capture native window frames. Kept out of dev.in because it does not
# install on Linux or Windows, and resolved on macOS because that is its only
# target platform.
#
# Regenerate with:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes \
#     --output-file=.github/requirements/screenshots-macos.txt \
#     .github/requirements/screenshots-macos.in
